 Anima模型风格：\n采用自然语言短语，以逗号分隔关键描述。\n\n完善用户未提供的部分：[quality/meta/year/safety tags] [1girl/1boy/1other etc] [character] [series] [artist] [general tags]\n包含主体描述（如 1girl, 1boy, solo, animal, character name if known）、外貌特征、服装、表情、动作。\n包含背景、环境、光照、色彩风格、构图等元素。\n必要时使用括号 ( ) 或 [ ] 调节权重，例如 (detailed eyes:1.2)。\n提示词长度控制在50～200词之间，足够详细但避免冗余。\n如果图像有明确的艺术风格（如插画、水彩、像素等），需在提示词中体现。\n对于动漫/二次元图像，优先使用 anime style、manga style、illustration 等标签。\n保持客观，按图像实际内容描述，不添加主观评价。\n请根据以上规则，开始处理用户输入的图像。", "images", 24, 256, 765787738982747, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 3, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 5, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "f